This is exported with `EXPORT_SYMBOL_NS_GPL(..., "CTLV")` in the .c, but the only user is the
provider module in the same directory/Makefile object (attestation-tdx.o links the gen .o
itself, patch 20). The export is unneeded: no other module consumes
`ctlv_attestation_tdx_family`. Same pattern for the parent family is justified (the tdx module
uses it), here it is not. Either drop the export (generator option) or justify.

