Summary:
- Generated `tdx_gen.c`/.h are not compiled by anything in this patch (Makefile untouched) so they
  are untested until 0020; consider squashing or compile-testing.
- `ctlv_attestation_tdx_family` is `EXPORT_SYMBOL_NS_GPL`'d although the sole user is the same module
  (unneeded export).
- Dead generated request-side accessors (`CTLV_IN_*`) for reply-only attrs.
- I could not run `ctlv-regen.sh` -c (jsonschema absent); node schemas match the spec by reading.
